---
title: Join
description: Join the McKenzie River Guides Association as an associate member or a guide.
navKey: join
permalink: /join/
---
<div class="page-hero compact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>Join the <em>association</em></h1>
      <p class="status">Guides and friends of the river, backing the McKenzie together since 1931.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="join">
      <div class="join-card a">
        <span class="eyebrow">Associate members</span>
        <h3>Join the association</h3>
        <p>For people who share our conservation philosophy, often our guides' clients.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A vote in association decisions, and you can hold office</li>
          <li>Take part in all association activities</li>
          <li>Your name on the members &amp; supporters list</li>
        </ul>
        <details class="how grow"><summary>How to become an associate member</summary><p>Send a letter or email asking to join, and ask two current MRGA members to be your sponsors. Each sponsor sends a letter of recommendation to the secretary or another <a href="/leadership/">officer</a>. The members vote on your application at the next annual meeting, held the second Saturday in January. We'll let you know the result after the meeting.</p></details>
        {% if text.join.associate_dues %}<div class="price">{{ text.join.associate_dues }} <small>per year</small></div>{% else %}<div class="price">$__ <small>per year</small> <span class="sample">Dues to come</span></div>{% endif %}
        <a class="btn" href="{{ text.join.associate_apply_url or ('mailto:' + settings.email + '?subject=Associate%20membership%20request%20(attn.%20Secretary)') }}">Ask to join as an associate</a>
      </div>
      <div class="join-card b">
        <span class="eyebrow">For guides</span>
        <h3>Join as a guide</h3>
        <p>For professional guides on the McKenzie who share our conservation philosophy and hold a current Oregon State Marine Board guide license.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A vote in association decisions, and you can hold office</li>
          <li>Take part in all association activities</li>
          <li>Your own page and listing in Find a Guide</li>
        </ul>
        <details class="how grow"><summary>How to become an MRGA guide</summary><p>Send a letter or email asking to join, and ask two current MRGA members to be your sponsors. Each sponsor sends a letter of recommendation to the secretary or another <a href="/leadership/">officer</a>. Include proof of your current Oregon State Marine Board guide license. The members vote on your application at the next annual meeting, held the second Saturday in January. We'll let you know the result after the meeting.</p></details>
        {% if text.join.guide_dues %}<div class="price" style="color:var(--river)">{{ text.join.guide_dues }} <small>per year</small></div>{% else %}<div class="price" style="color:var(--river)">$__ <small>per year</small> <span class="sample">Dues to come</span></div>{% endif %}
        <a class="btn btn-line" href="{{ text.join.guide_apply_url or ('mailto:' + settings.email + '?subject=Guide%20membership%20request%20(attn.%20Secretary)') }}">Ask to join as a guide</a>
      </div>
      <div class="join-card c" id="give">
        <span class="eyebrow">Tax-deductible giving</span>
        <h3>Give to the Foundation</h3>
        <p class="grow">MRGA dues aren't tax-deductible. The McKenzie Guides Foundation, a separate 501(c)(3), accepts tax-deductible gifts.</p>
        {% if settings.foundation_url %}<a class="btn btn-line" href="{{ settings.foundation_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit the Foundation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% else %}<span class="btn btn-line" aria-disabled="true">Foundation website coming soon</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="join-note">New associate and guide members are approved by a vote of the membership at the annual meeting. <a href="/members/">See our members &amp; supporters</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2>How membership works</h2></div></div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Ask to join</h3><p>Send a letter or email to the association asking to join. Guides include proof of a current Oregon State Marine Board guide license. {% if text.join.how_to_apply %}{{ text.join.how_to_apply }}{% endif %}</p></li>
      <li><h3>Two sponsors</h3><p>Two current MRGA members each send a letter of recommendation to the secretary or another <a href="/leadership/">officer</a>.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Membership vote</h3><p>The members vote on your application at the next annual meeting, the second Saturday in January. We'll let you know the result after the meeting.</p></li>
      <li><h3>You're on the list</h3><p>Once you're voted in, your name goes on the website: guides in Find a Guide, associates on Members &amp; supporters. No one is listed before the vote.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Questions</span><h2>Common questions</h2></div></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>Are dues tax-deductible?</summary><p>No. MRGA is a 501(c)(4) membership association, so dues aren't deductible as charitable donations. For a tax-deductible gift, give to the McKenzie Guides Foundation, a separate 501(c)(3).</p></details>
      <details><summary>When do memberships renew?</summary>{% if text.join.renewal %}{{ text.join.renewal | paras | safe }}{% else %}<p class="placeholder-text">Placeholder answer for the board to fill in.</p>{% endif %}</details>
      <details><summary>Who can join as a guide?</summary><p>Professional guides on the McKenzie who share our conservation philosophy and hold a current Oregon State Marine Board guide license. Like every new member, you need two current MRGA members as sponsors, and the members vote on your application at the annual meeting.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can associate members vote and hold office?</summary><p>Yes. Associate members are voting members of the association, can hold office and take part in all association activities.</p></details>
      <details><summary>When will my name appear on the website?</summary><p>After the membership votes you in at the annual meeting. We'll let you know the result after the meeting. Applicants aren't listed until then.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I update my listing?</summary><p>Active guides can edit their own Find a Guide card. Go to <a href="/edit-listing/">Edit my listing</a> and we'll email you a sign-in link. Changes show on the website within a few minutes.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
